    "text": "Hint : $\\because A^{100}=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}\\cos 100 \\theta & -\\cos 100 \\theta \\\\ \\sin 100 \\theta & \\cos 100 \\theta\\end{array}\\right]$\nAs $\\theta=\\frac{2 \\pi}{7}$\n$A^{100}=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}\n\\cos \\frac{200 \\pi}{7} & -\\sin \\frac{200 \\pi}{7} \\\\\n\\sin \\frac{200 \\pi}{7} & \\cos \\frac{200 \\pi}{7}\n\\end{array}\\right]=A^2$"
